### [Dauntless Log](dauntless_log)
= The first account of how it takes a ship: it drains the engines.
---
Speaker: dauntless
Title: Log playback
Audio: audio/SD01C0035
Presentation: portrait
---
What is it? Not sure sir it looks like a beacon of some sort. Take us in for a closer look, there might be some salvage worth gathering?. Engineering, why did we lose power to engines? Captain, unknown vessel appeared behind us. Get us out of here! Can?t sir, something is draining our engines.

### [Strange Object Sighted](strange_object_sighted)
= One-way: no answer authored, so the hail offers its own Close.
---
Speaker: ensign_rachel
Title: Report
Presentation: portrait
---
Ensign Rachel Reporting: That Strange Object could give us clues to what happen to the Dauntless

### [Web Generator Identified](web_generator)
---
Speaker: ensign_rachel
Title: Strange object Report
Presentation: portrait
---
Upon further study this Beacon is some sort of Warp field disruptor. We call it a Web Generator. You cannot travel at warp near it but impulse power should be unaffected. Contact TSN Command about the Web Generator.

- [Contact TSN Command]()

