### [Odessa Science Log](odessa_log)
= The scientist who came here on purpose, and why.
---
Speaker: odessa
Title: Log playback
Audio: audio/SD02C0164
Presentation: portrait
---
Science officer's log 76.2. This sector of space has an unusually high concentration of stellar creatures. It is an ideal place to study their behaviors in more details.  The Piranhas in this sector have been exhibiting aggressive behavior.  More so than has ever been reported. I think this might be a breeding ground. There is not much known about the breeding habits of these piranhas. This is an excellent opportunity for research but I still need to convince the captain to let us take a closer look.   The last run in left our long range communication array slightly chewed.

